 \"one spec file per row, written and read back cell-exact before its path is returned\"\n253\tversion = \"v1\"\n254\tstatus = \"Drafted\"\n255\tcomponent = \"CMP-006\"\n256\t```\n257\t\n258\tThe function is `wi_convert.write_spec_file(work_dir, row, order=None)` (line 552).\n259\t`intake.py` is what MINTS (`_mint`, `_mint_shape_refusal`, `mint_gap_rows`) and drives the\n260\twriter.\n261\t\n262\t**The exemplar, `docs/work/queued/WI-000-example.md`** — frontmatter verbatim:\n263\t\n264\t```\n265\t+++\n266\tid = \"WI-000\"\n267\ttitle = \"EXAMPLE work item (permanent exemplar — keep)\"\n268\tworkstream = \"example\"\n269\tsr_refs = []\n270\tneeds = []\n271\tbuildtier = \"medium\"\n272\tpriority = 0\n273\t+++\n274\t```\n275\t\n276\tIts own key documentation, condensed: all keys optional except `id` and `title`; **an absent\n277\tkey and an empty one mean the same thing, so empty keys are omitted rather than written as a\n278\twall of `= \"\"`**. `workstream` = the mutable grouping. `sr_refs` = the requirement ids it\n279\tdelivers. `needs` = predecessor ids; a bare id is a HARD edge, a `~`-prefixed id is a SOFT\n280\tedge, \"the `~` is meaning, not decoration, and is carried verbatim\". `specref` = the forward\n281\tbridge (rule R-E), a `docs/specs/WI-###.md` file or a `doc#anchor` that resolves while open\n282\tand clears at close. **`buildtier` is the frontmatter spelling** (`strong|medium|quick`;\n283\tlegacy `weak` reads as `quick`; \"the STARTING tier for this item's build sessions and never\n284\tcaps escalation\") — `BuildTier` is the registry-column spelling, not the key. `priority` int\n285\tdefault 0; `exclusive` semantic mutex keys; `blockref` (its PRESENCE is what makes a `queued`\n286\trow `blocked`); `est_tokens`; `safety_class` ∈\n287\t`ordinary|spine|gate|attestation|protected|high-risk|adjudication`, **fails closed** (absent\n288\treads `unclassified` and is never scheduled); `planmode = \"dual\"`; `brief` only on an\n289\tadjudication row; `order` is